<html>
    <head>
            <meta charset="UTF-8">
            <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
            <title>Odyra Safaris - Booking Made</title>
   </head>
<body style="margin: 0; padding: 20px; font-family: 'Kumbh Sans', 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;">
            <div style="display: block;">
                <p>Hi <%= name %>,</p>
                <p>Great news! We've successfully received your payment of  <strong><%= rideCost %> AUD</strong> for your upcoming ride with Odyra Safaris. Your booking is now fully confirmed and locked in.</p>
                 <h4>What to Expect Next?</h4>
                <p>The driver will give you a call to confirm your location, after which they'll proceed to pick you up.</p>
                <div>
                         <h4>Booking Summary</h4>
                          <p>Pickup Location: <span><%= pickup %></span></p>
                          <p>Dropoff Location: <span><%= dropoff %></span></p>
                          <p>Scheduled Pickup Time: <span><%= date %></span></p>
                           <p>Booking ID: <%= bookingId %></p>
                           <p>Ride Distance: <%= distance %></p>
                           <p>Ride Duration: <%= duration %></p>
                </div>
                <br>
               <p>If you have questions or concerns, our friendly Customer Success Team is always ready to help!</p>
               <p>Send us an email at support@odyra.com.au</p>
               <p>Thank you for choosing Odyra Safaris</p>
               <p>The Odyra Safaris Team.</p>
            </div>
</body>
</html>